This project fine-tunes the open-source models listed below. The fine-tuned
weights were initialized from their public pretrained weights, which were
trained on the BDD100K dataset (https://www.bdd100k.com/). Users should also
review the BDD100K terms of use.

The public traffic-cone datasets TraCon and FSOCO were used only for
multitask-v1 to multitask-v3. They were not used for multitask-v4 or later.

The original copyright and license notices of the upstream projects follow.

